{
  "_comment": "base-v1: the SFT data-space DMD recipe applied to MOSS-Image-Base (the SFT was tuned on GPT-scored preferences and runs over-saturated). Fresh start, seed 45, the SFT v2 lrs (LoRA 2e-6, step-time/Q 4e-5), 100 fake-only warmup updates. Teacher/real = Base 50-step CFG 3, empty negative skipping block 22 (the release defaults for Base too). Captions: trainer_samples_v3 scene_graph, compact JSON.",
